# Courier Flow

> **Source:** `app/api/courier/**`, `lib/server/biteship-shipment.ts`

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Seller
    participant O as Order
    participant C as Courier
    participant B as Biteship
    participant App as ReBites

    S->>O: Marks ready_for_pickup
    O->>App: POST /api/courier/assignments
    App->>B: Create Biteship shipment
    B-->>App: waybill + tracking_url
    App->>C: Assignment notification
    
    par External Courier (Biteship)
        C->>B: Accept shipment
        B->>App: Webhook PICKED_UP
        App->>O: order_status = out_for_delivery
        C->>B: Mark DELIVERED
        B->>App: Webhook DELIVERED
        App->>O: order_status = completed
    and Internal Courier (ReBites)
        C->>App: POST /assignments/[id]/accept
        C->>App: POST /assignments/[id]/pickup
        App->>O: order_status = out_for_delivery
        C->>App: POST /assignments/[id]/deliver
        App->>O: order_status = completed
    end
    
    App->>S: Earnings released
    App->>Buyer: Coins earned
```

---

## Courier States

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> available: Courier online
    available --> assigned: Gets assignment
    assigned --> en_route_to_pickup: Accepts
    en_route_to_pickup --> at_pickup: Arrives
    at_pickup --> en_route_to_delivery: Picks up
    en_route_to_delivery --> at_delivery: Arrives
    at_delivery --> completed: Delivers
    completed --> available: Ready for next
    
    assigned --> available: Rejects
    en_route_to_pickup --> available: Unassigns
    at_pickup --> available: Order cancelled
```

---

## Assignment Types

| Type | Source | Flow |
|------|--------|------|
| **External** | Biteship (JNE, SiCepat, etc.) | Biteship webhook |
| **Internal** | ReBites Courier (in-house) | App API |

